  "theme": "mdash",
  "_about": "M-style cluster after a photo of a current M car's cluster (no badges). Backdrop, G-meter and side gauges are one shader (mdash); the rev bars are mtach. Fuel and range from KombiIF statusRangeTankStatus (config.tankLitres is the full mark), outside temperature from EnvironmentalInformation. The setup rows follow the drive mode buttons. No speed limit sign: no app has found that signal yet. 'Leave room for the map' is not supported in this theme yet. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
